nset-0 isolate z-auto overflow-hidden bg-secure-blue object-center hidden xs:block lg:hidden"><div data-testid="background-media-image-wrapper" class="relative h-full w-full"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-bottom xlRedesign:object-center" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/5k8cfZ2eskfNFvVvu1AdNs/56426135a85a0bce0bff5d9647b5e364/background_2x.webp"/></div></div><div data-testid="background-media" class="absolute inset-0 isolate z-auto overflow-hidden bg-secure-blue object-center hidden lg:block"><div data-testid="background-media-image-wrapper" class="relative h-full w-full"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-bottom xlRedesign:object-center" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/5k8cfZ2eskfNFvVvu1AdNs/56426135a85a0bce0bff5d9647b5e364/background_2x.webp"/></div></div><div class="z-20 w-full max-w-[1296px] flex-col items-center lg:flex-row py-16 lg:py-0 flex gap-16 md:gap-24 lg:gap-4 justify-normal"><div class="flex-1 animate-fade-in lg:py-32 max-w-5xl"><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-start justify-normal space-y-8 w-full"><div class="w-full justify-center text-auto space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><span class="text-pure-white text-base !leading-[125%] uppercase font-light tracking-normal inline-block w-full text-left">1Password Credential Broker</span><h1 class="text-[40px] xs:text-5xl xlRedesign:text-[64px] !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-pure-white text-left [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">マシンとAIエージェントによる実行時の認証情報アクセス</h1></div><div class="text-xl !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-pure-white text-left"><p>実行時にAIエージェントとマシンワークロードを検証し、それぞれが受け取る権限を持つ認証情報のみを提供します。</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col flex-wrap gap-4 self-start md:flex-row md:items-start md:text-wrap mt-auto"><div><a id="3tx8yc0XXd55wpNsMYzNUx" role="link" data-testid="button" tabindex="0" class="cta-btn flex-1 group/button group-hover:cta-hovered hover:cta-hovered btn-refresh__primary light white dark w-full text-center" target="_self" href="/contact-sales"><span>デモをリクエスト</span></a></div><div><a href="https://www.1password.dev/brokered-access" id="4aqr3fYamQ7exLkBjwj3zN" role="link" data-testid="button" tabindex="0" class="cta-btn flex-1 group/button group-hover:cta-hovered hover:cta-hovered btn-refresh__secondary light white disable-group-hover dark w-full text-center" target="_blank"><span>プラン表示</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></header></div><section><div data-testid="page-section" class="mt-0 mb-0"><div data-testid="page-section-wrapper" class="bg-inherit rounded-default relative mx-auto max-w-redesignFullWidth"><div class="pb-6 pt-16 xlRedesign:pb-18 xlRedesign:pt-32 px-6 xlRedesign:mx-auto xlRedesign:px-18 mx-auto"><div class="relative flex w-full justify-start"><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between items-start mx-auto mb-12 w-full xlRedesign:mb-24 space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-balance space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><h2 class="text-[40px] xlRedesign:text-[64px] !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left [overflow-wrap:anywhere] xs:text-4xl xs:leading-[110%]">パイプラインから認証情報を排除する</h2></div><div class="text-xl !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left"><p>ワークロードは長期有効な認証情報を保持しません。自身の身元を証明し、承認された認証情報のみを実行時に取得します。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="content-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 xlRedesign:grid-cols-3"><div data-testid="content-grid-item" class="space-y-6"><div class="max-w-12"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/3iVboXClPbwFvuJ8VehPhu/69b68a6d6372df951795a33428fd194d/platform_icon.svg"/></div><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between flex-none items-start mb-8 md:items-start md:space-y-4 [&amp;_p]:font-light [&amp;_p]:text-base [&amp;_p]:leading-6 [&amp;_p]:-mt-3 [&amp;_p]:-mb-1 xlRedesign:mr-12 [&amp;_div]:text-left space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-balance space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">ジョブを識別できるプラットフォーム</h3></div><div class="text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left"><p>Credential Brokerは、ポリシーに基づいてワークロードのIDを確認し、その特定のジョブに対して承認された認証情報のみを配信します。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="content-grid-item" class="space-y-6"><div class="max-w-12"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/1Zg6zEIADTFJ0ySFKH3L62/f29e261754636ad9250503d971cdf75f/Radar.svg"/></div><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between flex-none items-start mb-8 md:items-start md:space-y-4 [&amp;_p]:font-light [&amp;_p]:text-base [&amp;_p]:leading-6 [&amp;_p]:-mt-3 [&amp;_p]:-mb-1 xlRedesign:mr-12 [&amp;_div]:text-left space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-balance space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">潜在的な被害範囲を抑える</h3></div><div class="text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left"><p>侵害された場合でも、アクセスは1Passwordがそのジョブに許可したものに限定されます。被害範囲は限定的で、保管庫全体が侵害されることはありません。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="content-grid-item" class="space-y-6"><div class="max-w-12"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/TiikVPXKXXRc54eolO0FM/075215723a7c98f6c6b94fb0d28df968/Clipboard.svg"/></div><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between flex-none items-start mb-8 md:items-start md:space-y-4 [&amp;_p]:font-light [&amp;_p]:text-base [&amp;_p]:leading-6 [&amp;_p]:-mt-3 [&amp;_p]:-mb-1 xlRedesign:mr-12 [&amp;_div]:text-left space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-balance space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">すべての配信で完全な帰属</h3></div><div class="text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left"><p>認証情報の配信は、アクセスがリクエストされたワークロードと、ポリシーによって認証された完全な帰属で記録されます。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="mx-auto max-w-redesignFullWidth rounded-default px-6 py-16 xlRedesign:px-18 xlRedesign:py-24 bg-transparent mt-6 mb-6"><div class="relative"><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between items-start xlRedesign:pb-0 space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-auto space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><span class="text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-base !leading-[125%] uppercase font-light tracking-normal inline-block w-full text-left">機能</span><h2 class="text-[40px] xs:text-5xl xlRedesign:text-[64px] !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-left [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">ワークフローを接続</h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-4 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 xlRedesign:flex xlRedesign:flex-row"><div class="xlRedesign:flex-1 xlRedesign:top-0 xlRedesign:self-start pt-16 xlRedesign:pt-32"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1232" height="658" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto mb-12 w-full max-w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/7yyrmvIJqDSIcJdOXe311H/4dc0858e7a27eb29b396f56e4f401bac/01_2x.webp"/><div class="pr-8"><h3><span class="text-4xl xs:text-[40px] xlRedesign:text-5xl !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-8 block font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100">GitHub Actionsを始める</span></h3><p class="text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100">GitHub Actionsで実行されるすべてのワークフローは、そのアイデンティティを1Passwordに証明することができ、承認された適切な認証情報を受け取ります。サービスアカウントトークンは不要で、すべての配信で完全に帰属されます。</p><a href="https://www.1password.dev/brokered-access/github-actions" role="link" data-testid="button" tabindex="0" class="cta-btn group/button group-hover:cta-hovered hover:cta-hovered btn-refresh__text-link light secure-blue sm light mt-4" target="_self"><span>GitHub Actions を設定する</span></a></div></div></div><div class="xlRedesign:flex-1 xlRedesign:top-0 xlRedesign:self-start pt-16 xlRedesign:pt-32"><div><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1232" height="658" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto mb-12 w-full max-w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/2h488pz7kgfv/4WDoZcdMsRIwuzlOQVAKv7/e84f2a9e6731fb43832ac656c28075a8/02_2x.webp"/><div class="pr-8"><h3><span class="text-4xl xs:text-[40px] xlRedesign:text-5xl !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-8 block font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100">カスタムOIDC接続でさらに掘り下げる</span></h3><p class="text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100">OIDCトークンを発行するシステムは、1Passwordに直接認証でき、承認された認証情報をのみを取得できます。サービスアカウントトークンやシークレットが環境に保管されることはなく、すべての配信は完全に帰属しています。</p><a href="https://www.1password.dev/brokered-access/custom-workflow" role="link" data-testid="button" tabindex="0" class="cta-btn group/button group-hover:cta-hovered hover:cta-hovered btn-refresh__text-link light secure-blue sm light mt-4" target="_self"><span>カスタム OIDC ワークフローを構成する</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div data-testid="simplePromo" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-bits-blue-new-100 mx-auto my-6 max-w-redesignFullWidth rounded-default"><div class="relative z-10 w-full px-6 py-16 xlRedesign:py-24 xlRedesign:px-72"><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between items-start mx-auto space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-balance space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><span class="text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-base !leading-[125%] uppercase font-light tracking-normal inline-block w-full text-center">発見、保護、監査</span><h2 class="text-[40px] xs:text-5xl xlRedesign:text-[64px] !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-center [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Credential Brokerは、Unified Accessプラットフォームの一部です</h2></div><div class="text-xl !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-iron-ore-new-800 text-opacity-100 text-center"><p>すべてのアイデンティティへのアクセスを発見、保護、監査するプラットフォームです。</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col flex-wrap gap-4 self-start md:flex-row md:items-start md:text-wrap mt-auto justify-center"><div><a id="1shENvmfYKwU9WCIWMw58T" role="link" data-testid="button" tabindex="0" class="cta-btn flex-1 group/button group-hover:cta-hovered hover:cta-hovered btn-refresh__secondary light secure-blue light w-full text-center" target="_self" href="/platform"><span>Unified Accessについての詳細</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="bg-iron-ore-new-50 mt-6 mb-6 rounded-default relative mx-auto max-w-redesignFullWidth"><div class="pb-6 pt-16 xlRedesign:pb-18 xlRedesign:pt-32 px-6 xlRedesign:mx-auto xlRedesign:px-18 mx-auto"><div class="pb-10 xlRedesign:pb-6"><h2 class="text-[40px] xs:text-5xl xlRedesign:text-[64px] !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-intrepid-blue mb-16">Credential Brokerに関するよくある質問</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-10 xlRedesign:grid-cols-2 border-intrepid-blue"><div><div data-testid="faq-item-0" class="border-t-1 border-b-1 xlRedesign:border-b-0 xlRedesign:border-t-1 xlRedesign:last:border-b-1 border-iron-ore-new-700"><div class="relative flex py-8"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-redesign-normal text-iron-ore-700 min-w-0 flex-1 pr-8 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1Password Credential Brokerとは？</h3><button aria-controls="faq-0-desc" aria-label="Answer to &#x27;1Password Credential Brokerとは？&#x27;" aria-expanded="true" class="text-iron-ore-700 self-start before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:h-full before:w-11/12 before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]" data-testid="faq-item-button-0" id="faq-0"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-iron-ore-new-700" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="icon"><line id="line" x1="1" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12" stroke-width="2"></line><line id="line_2" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" stroke-width="2" data-testid="faq-item-icon-closed-0" class="opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none"></line></g></svg></button></div><div id="faq-0-desc" class="pr-12 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-[1000px] opacity-100 pb-8 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:block" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-0" aria-hidden="false"><div class="[&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1 text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:px-px [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-intrepid-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline text-iron-ore-700"><p>1Password Credential Brokerは、マシンワークロードとAIエージェントを実行時に認証し、承認された認証情報のみを提供します。ワークロードは自身の身元を証明し、ポリシーに基づいた認証情報を取得します。長期的な保管庫へのアクセスは付与されません。</p></div></div></div><div data-testid="faq-item-1" class="border-b-1 xlRedesign:border-b-0 xlRedesign:border-t-1 xlRedesign:last:border-b-1 border-iron-ore-new-700"><div class="relative flex py-8"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-redesign-normal text-iron-ore-700 min-w-0 flex-1 pr-8 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1Password Credential Brokerがシークレットを保護する方法とは？</h3><button aria-controls="faq-1-desc" aria-label="Answer to &#x27;1Password Credential Brokerがシークレットを保護する方法とは？&#x27;" aria-expanded="false" class="text-iron-ore-700 self-start before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:h-full before:w-11/12 before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]" data-testid="faq-item-button-1" id="faq-1"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-iron-ore-new-700" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="icon"><line id="line" x1="1" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12" stroke-width="2"></line><line id="line_2" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" stroke-width="2" data-testid="faq-item-icon-closed-1" class="opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none"></line></g></svg></button></div><div id="faq-1-desc" class="pr-12 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-1" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="[&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1 text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:px-px [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-intrepid-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline text-iron-ore-700"><p>Credential Brokerは、統合キーと、1Passwordのコンフィデンシャルコンピューティングエンクレーブ（隔離された、ハードウェアで保護された実行環境）内にロックされたキーの2つのキーですべてのシークレットを暗号化します。認証情報の復号化には両方のキーが必要です。どちらも単独でシークレットにアクセスすることはできません。</p></div></div></div><div data-testid="faq-item-2" class="border-b-1 xlRedesign:border-b-0 xlRedesign:border-t-1 xlRedesign:last:border-b-1 border-iron-ore-new-700"><div class="relative flex py-8"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-redesign-normal text-iron-ore-700 min-w-0 flex-1 pr-8 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1Password Credential Brokerが認証情報を配信する際に記録される内容とは？</h3><button aria-controls="faq-2-desc" aria-label="Answer to &#x27;1Password Credential Brokerが認証情報を配信する際に記録される内容とは？&#x27;" aria-expanded="false" class="text-iron-ore-700 self-start before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:h-full before:w-11/12 before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]" data-testid="faq-item-button-2" id="faq-2"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-iron-ore-new-700" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="icon"><line id="line" x1="1" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12" stroke-width="2"></line><line id="line_2" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" stroke-width="2" data-testid="faq-item-icon-closed-2" class="opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none"></line></g></svg></button></div><div id="faq-2-desc" class="pr-12 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-2" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="[&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1 text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:px-px [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-intrepid-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline text-iron-ore-700"><p>すべての認証情報の配信は、アクセスがリクエストされたワークロードと、ポリシーによって認証された完全な帰属で記録されます。セキュリティチームは、すべての発行イベントに対して完全な監査証跡を取得できます。</p></div></div></div></div><div><div data-testid="faq-item-3" class="border-b-1 xlRedesign:border-b-0 xlRedesign:border-t-1 xlRedesign:last:border-b-1 border-iron-ore-new-700"><div class="relative flex py-8"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-redesign-normal text-iron-ore-700 min-w-0 flex-1 pr-8 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1Password Credential Brokerがワークロードのアイデンティティを検証する方法とは？</h3><button aria-controls="faq-3-desc" aria-label="Answer to &#x27;1Password Credential Brokerがワークロードのアイデンティティを検証する方法とは？&#x27;" aria-expanded="false" class="text-iron-ore-700 self-start before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:h-full before:w-11/12 before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]" data-testid="faq-item-button-3" id="faq-3"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-iron-ore-new-700" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="icon"><line id="line" x1="1" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12" stroke-width="2"></line><line id="line_2" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" stroke-width="2" data-testid="faq-item-icon-closed-3" class="opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none"></line></g></svg></button></div><div id="faq-3-desc" class="pr-12 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-3" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="[&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1 text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:px-px [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-intrepid-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline text-iron-ore-700"><p>Credential Brokerは、認証情報を配信する前に、Workload Identity Federationを使用してワークロードのIDを検証します。Workload Identity Federationは、手動管理型のサービスアカウントトークンに依存することなく、プラットフォームが実行されている特定のジョブを証明するのを可能にする標準規格です。検証が完了すると、ワークロードは承認されたジョブの認証情報のみを受け取り、それ以外のものは何も受け取りません。</p></div></div></div><div data-testid="faq-item-4" class="border-b-1 xlRedesign:border-b-0 xlRedesign:border-t-1 xlRedesign:last:border-b-1 border-iron-ore-new-700"><div class="relative flex py-8"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-redesign-normal text-iron-ore-700 min-w-0 flex-1 pr-8 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1Password Credential BrokerはGitHub Actionsで動作しますか？</h3><button aria-controls="faq-4-desc" aria-label="Answer to &#x27;1Password Credential BrokerはGitHub Actionsで動作しますか？&#x27;" aria-expanded="false" class="text-iron-ore-700 self-start before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:h-full before:w-11/12 before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]" data-testid="faq-item-button-4" id="faq-4"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-iron-ore-new-700" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="icon"><line id="line" x1="1" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12" stroke-width="2"></line><line id="line_2" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" stroke-width="2" data-testid="faq-item-icon-closed-4" class="opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none"></line></g></svg></button></div><div id="faq-4-desc" class="pr-12 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-4" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="[&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1 text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:px-px [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-intrepid-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline text-iron-ore-700"><p>はい。GitHub Actionsのワークフローは、Workload Identity Federationを使用して1PasswordにIDを証明し、承認された適切な認証情報を受け取ることができます。サービスアカウントトークンは不要であり、すべての配信は完全な帰属とともに記録されます。</p></div></div></div><div data-testid="faq-item-5" class="border-b-1 xlRedesign:border-b-0 xlRedesign:border-t-1 xlRedesign:last:border-b-1 border-iron-ore-new-700"><div class="relative flex py-8"><h3 class="text-[22px] xs:text-2xl xlRedesign:text-2xl !leading-[120%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-redesign-normal text-iron-ore-700 min-w-0 flex-1 pr-8 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">1Password Credential Brokerは一般提供されていますか？</h3><button aria-controls="faq-5-desc" aria-label="Answer to &#x27;1Password Credential Brokerは一般提供されていますか？&#x27;" aria-expanded="false" class="text-iron-ore-700 self-start before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-0 before:h-full before:w-11/12 before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]" data-testid="faq-item-button-5" id="faq-5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="stroke-iron-ore-new-700" xmlns="https://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g id="icon"><line id="line" x1="1" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12" stroke-width="2"></line><line id="line_2" x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" stroke-width="2" data-testid="faq-item-icon-closed-5" class="opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 motion-reduce:transition-none"></line></g></svg></button></div><div id="faq-5-desc" class="pr-12 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-5" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="[&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:mb-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li]:mb-1 text-base !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:px-px [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-intrepid-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline text-iron-ore-700"><p>まだ一般提供されていません。Credential Brokerは現在、すべてのEnterprise Password Managerのお客様向けにプレビュー版が公開されています。これにはGitHub ActionとカスタムOIDC構成が含まれています。開始するには、こちらのドキュメントページをご覧ください：<a href="https://1password.dev/environments/credential-broker" node="[object Object]" tabindex="-1">1password.dev/environments/credential-broker</a>。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div data-testid="simplePromo" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-secure-blue mx-auto my-6 max-w-redesignFullWidth rounded-default"><div class="relative z-10 w-full px-6 py-16 xlRedesign:py-24 xlRedesign:px-72"><div data-testid="text-lockup" class="flex h-full flex-col"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between items-start mx-auto space-y-8 md:max-w-small xlRedesign:max-w-medium"><div class="w-full text-balance space-y-6"><div class="space-y-6"><h2 class="text-[40px] xs:text-5xl xlRedesign:text-[64px] !leading-[110%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light text-pure-white text-center [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Runtime access for every machine and AI agent starts with 1Password</h2></div><div class="text-xl !leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.02em] font-light [&amp;_a]:transition-all [&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue [&amp;_a]:border-2 [&amp;_a]:border-transparent [&amp;_a]:rounded [&amp;_a]:underline hover:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue hover:[&amp;_a]:no-underline focus:[&amp;_a]:text-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:outline-none focus:[&amp;_a]:border-secure-blue focus:[&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:-mx-[7px] [&amp;_a]:px-2 [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-outside [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 text-pure-white text-center"><p>Meet with a member of our team to discuss how 1Password Credential Broker can extend your existing 1Password foundation to every workload and AI agent.</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col flex-wrap gap-4 self-start md:flex-row md:items-start md:text-wrap mt-auto justify-center"><div><a id="3LEtVCHwfxqzuf0OS4fEZK" role="link" data-testid="button" tabindex="0" class="cta-btn flex-1 group/button group-hover:cta-hovered 